cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Synthetic Two-Plant Hydropower Balance Benchmark"
abstract: >
  A reproducible synthetic benchmark for hourly water-balance modelling in a
  two-plant hydropower cascade. Version 1.0.0 contains frozen inflow scenarios,
  deterministic reference results, optimisation reference results, figures and
  interoperability specifications.
authors:
